OL,3,AHarry says he 'slipped into depression'
OL,4,Aafter leaving UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex has said he "slipped
OL,7,Finto depression for about two weeks"
OL,8,Fafter relocating to Canada in 2019
OL,9,Fahead of his move to the US.
OL,11,FPrince Harry, who recently returned to
OL,12,Fthe UK with his wife Meghan and their
OL,13,Ftwo children, said he had originally
OL,14,Fleft the country to "get some space."
OL,16,FThe duke also discussed feeling
OL,17,F"emotionally numb" after the death of
OL,18,Fhis mother Diana, Princess of Wales,
OL,19,Fbecause he felt "disloyal and guilty
OL,20,Ffor the possibility of being happy and
OL,21,Fjoyful without her".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
